{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Through The Pain</strong> is a chaotic low-poly adventure where you control a hyperactive spinning meme cat trying to survive one absurd world after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: <strong>cross the entire world without losing your mind</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073340/extras/689ecccb2b42caece07098f36ef37c89.poster.avif?t=1764490251\" width=800 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073340/extras/689ecccb2b42caece07098f36ef37c89.webm?t=1764490251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073340/extras/689ecccb2b42caece07098f36ef37c89.mp4?t=1764490251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, bounce, and spin through a series of wild themed zones \u2014 icy mountains, dusty deserts, western canyons, peaceful forests, and more. Each biome is packed with moving traps and ridiculous obstacles designed to make you laugh, rage, and immediately try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake can launch you back, flip you upside down, or send you spinning into trouble.<br>Every success pushes you deeper into chaos \u2014 and closer to the final stage:<br>a <strong>full-on disco party</strong> where the cat\u2019s friends are waiting to celebrate your victory.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073340/extras/8212b787c5d62d3465683bb588818980.avif?t=1764490251\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073340/extras_big/8212b787c5d62d3465683bb588818980.webp?t=1764490251 width=1560 height=975 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Play as a spinning meme cat with physics that never behave<br>\u2022 One long continuous level filled with handcrafted traps and surprises<br>\u2022 Multiple themed biomes with unique challenges<br>\u2022 Chaotic \u201cfail-and-try-again\u201d fun inspired by rage platformers<br>\u2022 Fast resets, quick attempts, and constant \u201cI swear this time I got it\u201d moments<br>\u2022 A disco ending that feels earned after all the pain</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One world. One spinning cat.<br>Countless attempts.<br>Pure chaotic fun.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Through the Pain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4073340/8e2747f86b0dfb0f075537667cd90444d726e402.jpg"},{"name":"Untouchable Spinner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4073340/6a18c641a76dbc5db2aed5d71a508591f435fede.jpg"},{"name":"Certified Pain Enjoyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4073340/cbe7b26c1df86c1e9f46132e8eff2e5429633569.jpg"},{"name":"Horny Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4073340/ba636e369db9efa0bd98df15ad53633c5df86a34.jpg"},{"name":"Destiny Rejected You","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4073340/079829f5d7145e73587bedd3b8d1365db39834d4.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4073340?t=1764490251","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4073340?t=1764490251","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073340/29810e92d67a8d2d2002c9b686b9a4cc93b51beb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764490251","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073340/29810e92d67a8d2d2002c9b686b9a4cc93b51beb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764490251","categories":[{"